+# leaves the waiting queue and is never peeked here again) -- so nothing
+# about GPU/offload state could plausibly have changed in between, and
+# it's deferred instead of repeating the whole dance again this tick.
+# See the timestamp's write site (HIT_DIVERGED reconcile) and read site
+# (top of the waiting-queue walk) below. Matches
+# the same "pop, defer to step_skipped_waiting, try the next waiting
